### LLM Cost Control Tracker API — manual probe file (M19, §14.3)
### Usage: open in VS Code with the REST Client extension, or run with `curl`.
### Before running: obtain a valid gateway JWT (configure GatewayAuth in appsettings).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@token = REPLACE_WITH_VALID_JWT

###

### 1. Health check (no auth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Budget check — allowed caller (must have a budget set via admin app)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/check
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "callerId": "alice@example.com",
  "model": "gpt-4o"
}

###

### 3. Budget check — caller with no budget (fail-closed by default)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/budget/check
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "callerId": "unknown@example.com"
}

###

### 4. Usage capture — successful accrual
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/usage/capture
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "callerId": "alice@example.com",
  "model": "gpt-4o",
  "tokens": {
    "input": 1000,
    "output": 500,
    "cacheRead": 200,
    "cacheWrite": 0
  },
  "requestId": "manual-test-001"
}

###

### 5. Usage capture — idempotency (same requestId, should not double-accrue)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/usage/capture
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "callerId": "alice@example.com",
  "model": "gpt-4o",
  "tokens": {
    "input": 1000,
    "output": 500,
    "cacheRead": 200,
    "cacheWrite": 0
  },
  "requestId": "manual-test-001"
}

###

### 6. Usage capture — unknown model (should return 400 unknown_model)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/usage/capture
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "callerId": "alice@example.com",
  "model": "nonexistent-model-xyz",
  "tokens": {
    "input": 100,
    "output": 50,
    "cacheRead": 0,
    "cacheWrite": 0
  }
}

###

### 7. Localhost pricing file import (no auth — localhost only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pricing/import
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "generatedAt": "2026-06-25T12:00:00Z",
  "currency": "USD",
  "unit": "per-1M-tokens",
  "providers": [
    {
      "provider": "openai",
      "models": [
        {
          "model": "gpt-4o",
          "fetchedAt": "2026-06-25T12:00:00Z",
          "prices": {
            "input": 2.50,
            "output": 10.00,
            "cacheRead": 1.25,
            "cacheWrite": null
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

###

### 8. Pricing import — invalid file (should return 422 with errors)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pricing/import
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "generatedAt": "2026-06-25T12:00:00Z",
  "currency": "USD",
  "unit": "per-1M-tokens",
  "providers": []
}
